    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "The cancellation of the NEET-UG 2026 medical entrance exam followed a structured chain of evidence. A whistleblower from Sikar provided documentary evidence of a match between leaked PDFs and the chemistry section of the test administered on May 3. This disclosure prompted the National Testing Agency, the exam administrator, to initiate a referral to the federal investigative agency. The subsequent application of legal procedure led to the arrest of thirteen people, and a corrective measure was scheduled—a re-examination set for June 21.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Sage",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "how-4",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [
        "how_fragments_expanded_to_contiguous_span"
      ],
      "fit": 0.91
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "An examination for medical college admission on May 3 became the focus of an investigation into a breach of protocol. The trigger for referral was an email containing PDFs that matched the chemistry paper, sent by a source of the tip. This step in the disclosure process led the testing agency to escalate the matter to a formal investigation. The outcome of the breach was the cancellation of the compromised exam, with a follow-up examination scheduled to attempt rectification.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Sage",
        "fragments": [
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-0",
          "result-2"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "When allegations of a leak surfaced regarding the May 3 entrance exam, the authority failing in oversight received unsolicited communication from an unsubstantiated accuser. However, the materials provided constituted a reason for the investigation. The authority's referral to a bureaucratic apparatus resulted in the arrest of suspects, an enforcement action that was part of the systemic response. The final result was the disruption to the academic cycle, forcing a re-do of the examination.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Sage",
